msgid ""
"Rebel Engine has nodes to draw sprites, polygons, particles, and all sorts "
"of stuff. For most cases, this is enough; but not always. Before crying in "
"fear, angst, and rage because a node to draw that specific *something* does "
"not exist... it would be good to know that it is possible to easily make any "
