msgid "**Template - Top-down wall in 3/4 perspective (tall walls):**"
msgstr ""
"**Plantilla - Pared Arriba-abajo en perspectiva de 3/4 (paredes altas):**"

msgid ""
"When using this template, set the \"Snap Options\" Step to ``Vector2(64, "
