msgid "Adjusting the pivot"
msgstr "Ajustando el pivote"

msgid ""
"The pivot can be adjusted by changing the *offset* property in the Sprite:"
msgstr ""
"El pivote puede ser ajustado cambiando la propiedad *offset* en el Sprite:"

