msgid ""
"It is possible, however, to make local modifications by using *Scene "
"Inheritance*. Try to open the imported scene and the following dialog will "
"appear:"
msgstr ""
"Sin embargo, es posible hacer modificaciones locales utilizando la *Herencia "
"de Escenas*. Intenta abrir la escena importada y aparecerá el siguiente "
"cuadro de diálogo:"

