#, fuzzy
msgid "The types of collision shapes available in 3D in Rebel Engine."
msgstr "Los tipos de formas de colisión disponibles en 3D en Godot."

msgid "Using a convex or a concave mesh as a collision shape."
msgstr "Usando una malla convexa o cóncava como forma de colisión."

msgid "Performance considerations regarding 3D collisions."
msgstr "Consideraciones de rendimiento en relación con las colisiones 3D."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine provides many kinds of collision shapes, with different "
