"de fondo, y varios nodos relacionados con la interfaz "
"gráfica :ref:`MeshInstance <class_MeshInstance>`."

msgid ""
"The GUI-related :ref:`MeshInstance <class_MeshInstance>` nodes already have "
"scripts attached to them. These scripts will set the texture of "
"a :ref:`Viewport <class_Viewport>` node to the albedo texture of the "
"material of the :ref:`MeshInstance <class_MeshInstance>` node. This is used "
